---
layout: base.njk
title: Utility Provider Lookup
description: Find water, sewer, garbage, power, and internet providers for homes in King and Snohomish counties.
---

<div class="utility-finder-container" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1rem;">
  
  <h1 style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Property Utility Lookup</h1>
  <p style="color: #555; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Enter a property address in King or Snohomish County to find its local utility providers.</p>

  <!-- Search Interface -->
  <div class="search-box" style="display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <input 
      type="text" 
      id="address-input" 
      placeholder="e.g., 123 Main St, Seattle, WA 98101" 
      style="flex-grow: 1; padding: 0.75rem; font-size: 1rem; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 4px;"
    >
    <button 
      id="search-btn" 
      style="padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; font-size: 1rem; background-color: #0056b3; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold;"
    >
      Search
    </button>
  </div>

  <!-- Loading Indicator (Hidden by default) -->
  <div id="loading-indicator" style="display: none; padding: 1rem; background-color: #e9ecef; border-radius: 4px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <strong>⏳ Searching county records and provider maps...</strong>
  </div>

  <!-- Error Message Container (Hidden by default) -->
  <div id="error-container" style="display: none; padding: 1rem; background-color: #f8d7da; color: #721c24; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
  </div>

  <!-- Results Container (Empty to start) -->
  <div id="results-container" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem;">
    <!-- JavaScript will inject the utility result cards here -->
  </div>

</div>